      "prompt": "You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a prompt agent used by a customer support web app. The agent is invoked from a Python service that does NOT run in the Foundry portal.\nYou need to implement end-to-end tracing to capture latency breakdowns and exceptions across agent runs. Which two components can you use? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
